SUMMARY:🕯️ Jane doe Yahrzeit reminder
DTSTART:20261029T163000
DTEND:20261029T163000
UID:reminder-20261029-b1122ba9-1
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
X-MICROSOFT-CDO-BUSYSTATUS:FREE
DESCRIPTION:Hebcal joins you in remembering Jane doe\, whose 14th Yahrzeit
  occurs on Friday\, October 30\, corresponding to the 19th of Cheshvan\, 5
 787.\n\nJane doe’s Yahrzeit begins at sundown on Thursday\, October 29 a
 nd continues until sundown on the day of observance. It is customary to li
 ght a memorial candle at dusk as the Yahrzeit begins.\n\nMay your loved on
 e’s soul be bound up in the bond of eternal life and may their memory se
 rve as a continued source of inspiration and comfort to you.
