X-MICROSOFT-CDO-BUSYSTATUS:FREE
DESCRIPTION:Hebcal joins you in remembering Jane doe\, whose 15th Yahrzeit
  occurs on Friday\, November 19\, corresponding to the 19th of Cheshvan\, 
 5788.\n\nJane doe’s Yahrzeit begins at sundown on Thursday\, November 18
  and continues until sundown on the day of observance. It is customary to 
 light a memorial candle at dusk as the Yahrzeit begins.\n\nMay your loved 
 one’s soul be bound up in the bond of eternal life and may their memory 
 serve as a continued source of inspiration and comfort to you.
